# Local editor / IDE cruft. Not in .gitignore's reach for vsce, which only
# reads this file — these were shipping stale copies of package.json.
.history/**
.idea/**

# Already-built release artifacts must never end up inside the next package.
*.vsix

# README screenshots. vsce rewrites relative image links to raw.githubusercontent
# URLs at package time, so the Marketplace loads them from the repository and they
# do not need to travel inside the VSIX. Together they were ~1.8 MB.
# What must stay: images/icon.png (the extension icon), images/commit-icon.svg
# and images/icons/** (loaded at runtime for the change card), all still shipped.
images/logo.png
images/icon-128.png
images/assets/**
images/*.gif
images/git-graph.png
images/three-way-merge.png
images/conflicts-list.png

# The changelog is split by language, and pre-1.0.0 history is archived.
# Only CHANGELOG.md is uploaded by vsce (it is the single changelog the
# Marketplace renders); the other two are read on GitHub through the
# absolute links at the top of CHANGELOG.md.
CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md
CHANGELOG-archive.md
